  "notes": "Early-game hook: Polish contingents in Iraq/Kuwait and UNIFIL can post counter-terror and base-security contracts in mesopotamia and lebanon_south; the main Polish role is mid/late campaign in the suwalki_gap and baltic_coast. Real-world: Poland operates Abrams (M1A1 FEP, M1A2 SEPv3) and is buying 96 AH-64E; it does not operate AH-1Z, Bradley or MaxxPro (it does field M-ATV and Cougar). Weapons that use 7.62x54R are being retired, so most Polish squad weapons cannot disable vehicles under the game rule; the WKW Wilk (.50) can.",
